# .env.test.enc
# Test tier — encrypted in place with dotenvx (`pnpm exec dotenvx encrypt -f .env.test.enc --no-armor`).
# Non-secret test config; secrets (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY) come from the
# git-ignored .env.personal overlay loaded by vitest.setup.ts. NODE_ENV is set to 'test'
# by vitest itself, never here.

# ─── System ───────────────────────────────────────
